# PgBouncer SCRAM verifier list — DO NOT hand-edit, DO NOT commit the real file.
#
# Format: "<role>" "<SCRAM verifier exactly as Postgres stores it>"
# The verifier is NOT the password; it's the value in pg_authid.rolpassword.
#
# Generate the real db/pgbouncer/userlist.txt AFTER creating the role:
#   ./db/pgbouncer/gen-userlist.sh          # reads it out of the running arena-db
#
# The result looks like this (one line):
"app_readonly" "SCRAM-SHA-256$4096:BASE64SALT==$BASE64STOREDKEY=:BASE64SERVERKEY="
